  "title": "rtpdump: treat the magic number as just an array of octets.",
  "description": "It's not a C null-termianted character string, it's just a sequence of\noctets at the beginning of an rtpdump file, so use memcmp() rather than\nstrncmp().\n\nWhile we're at it, compute the size of the magic number from the size of\nthe string, rather than hardcoding it.",
